# Reaches the tournament mod's SPECIAL/match PRESS START hook (D5077) against iomoont with
# a real lottery win: no ROM patch and no driver probe, run against build/sdl3pinmame.
#
# The rule sub_D4CF4 applies at every game's end (its game-over dispatch, sub_D3145 ->
# sub_D46F8 at D3237): it divides the player's own score-digit cell [413C:0016] by 10 and
# compares the remainder, at D4DCB, against the counter [4000:113F], which the timer-0 ISR
# increments once per delivered tick (D030E/D0315, F3).  On equality sub_D4FDC banks a
# credit and takes the D5076/D5077 trampoline the mod hooks; otherwise the game ends through
# the mod's other hook at D5123.
#
# Two controls aim it, and both are needed because the counter is not fixed:
#   * each of the twelve scoring slots below presses either a lane (KEYCODE_Y, 100,000,
#     units digit 0 -- every lane's award ends in zero, docs/iomoon_game_rules.md 3.3.1) or
#     the inner bank / Fondo Bancada (KEYCODE_I, 50,001, units digit 1, 3.3.6).  The score's
#     units digit is exactly the number of I slots; four per ball keeps every ball above the
#     100,000 short-ball replay threshold (F10 0x43) whichever key each slot takes.
#   * every event from the coin press onward is shifted one frame later, which moves the
#     counter without touching the score.
# Five I slots at a one-frame shift puts both at 5.  The compare lands at ms 166494 and
# NVRAM's credit triple (0x083/0x116/0x20C, F10) goes 0,0,0 -> 1,1,1.
#
# The four START taps after PRESS START are part of the capture: this occurrence does not
# release on them, where the D5123 one releases on the first press.
#
# Keys as scripts/keyscripts/iomoon-en.keys: 1/5 are START/COIN, SPACE plunges, Q drains,
# DOWN follows the next ball.
    40 mark boot
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
    80 mark boot-setting-country
   640 mark attract
  6641 mark credit
  6641 tap 8 KEYCODE_5
  6761 mark ball-1-start
  6761 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  6911 mark ball-1-in-play
  6911 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  7031 tap 10 KEYCODE_I
  7101 tap 10 KEYCODE_I
  7171 tap 10 KEYCODE_I
  7241 tap 10 KEYCODE_I
  7611 mark ball-1-drained
  7611 tap 10 KEYCODE_Q
  7671 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  8021 mark ball-2-in-play
  8021 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  8141 tap 10 KEYCODE_I
  8211 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  8281 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  8351 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  8721 mark ball-2-drained
  8721 tap 10 KEYCODE_Q
  8781 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9131 mark ball-3-in-play
  9131 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  9251 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  9321 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  9391 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  9461 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
  9831 mark ball-3-drained-gameover
  9831 tap 10 KEYCODE_Q
  9891 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9995 mark lottery
 10330 mark special-press-start
 10401 mark post-game
 10501 mark press-start-ack
 10501 tap 20 KEYCODE_1
 11501 mark press-start-ack-2
 11501 tap 20 KEYCODE_1
 12501 mark press-start-ack-3
 12501 tap 20 KEYCODE_1
 13501 mark press-start-ack-4
 13501 tap 20 KEYCODE_1
 14201 mark done
 14201 quit
